# mattermost-oci-deploy

Private Mattermost on OCI Free Tier: OpenTofu → VM → Docker Compose (Postgres, Caddy, Mattermost prod + idle test).

## Sibling project

Community Admin plugin (separate repo): https://github.com/lucas-albers-lz4/mattermost-plugin-community-admin  
Install on VM: `/opt/mattermost/ops/install-community-admin-plugin.sh` — see `docs/06-operations.md`.

## Test instance

- Script: `scripts/manage-test-instance.sh` (on VM: `/opt/mattermost/ops/manage-test-instance.sh`)
- Test URL/host in `generated.env` / docs; access IP-restricted via `TEST_ALLOWED_CIDR`
- Default: test container **stopped** to save RAM — `start` before testing, `stop` when done

## Do not commit

`.env`, `.mattermost-secrets.env`, `generated.env`, `terraform.tfvars`, `*.tfstate*`, keys, backup archives.

## Common commands

```sh
scripts/deploy-from-zero.sh --fresh
scripts/security-audit.sh --repo-only
tofu -chdir=infra/opentofu validate
```

On VM: `/opt/mattermost/ops/health-check.sh`, `security-audit.sh --host-only`

## Agent defaults

- Minimal diffs; match existing shell/docs style
- Do not commit or push unless explicitly asked
- Prefer `docs/` and `README.md` for operator-facing notes over new ad-hoc markdown files
